      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "My current understanding is the custom animation system is basically just an exploit of the gesture system. You are overriding the animations for gestures with your own custom animation. Those gesture animations require full IK. Without those gesture animations there's nothing to override which is why full IK is required for animations (this may be wrong but like I said that's my current understanding of it). So to answer your question, no, it isn't just a hotkey for an animation.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
