      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5a5824d51ddd8350d9229b0e|full_name}: I always thought it would be even better if gestures stayed as is but our custom animations could be selected from a list or we could definitely props so we could easier use the cool things we put on our avatars. For example, I put guns on some of mine and the animations have resulted in awkward moments where I'm talking to someone or holding my arm out and suddenly \"whoops sorry for shooting you in the face\".",
